      "kicker": "Module 1",
      "narration": "Module one: cardiac arrest and the Chain of Survival. This is the human heart in sinus rhythm. With every beat, blood leaves through the aorta to the body, and through the pulmonary trunk to the lungs. In this module we answer three questions. What is cardiac arrest? How often do people survive it? And which chain of actions gives them the best chance?",
